<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Eslam Mesalam | Front-End Developer</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Eslam Mesalam Front-End Developer Portfolio" />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#07101d;
      --bg-2:#0b1830;
      --surface:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      --surface-2:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --border:rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
      --text:#ffffff;
      --muted:#b8c4dc;
      --blue:#6ea8ff;
      --purple:#8f6bff;
      --cyan:#65d6ff;
      --shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
      --radius:26px;
      --transition:.35s ease;
    }

    *{
      margin:0;
      padding:0;
      box-sizing:border-box;
      scroll-behavior:smooth;
    }

    body{
      font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color:var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(110,168,255,.18), transparent 25%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(143,107,255,.16), transparent 25%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, var(--bg-2) 100%);
      overflow-x:hidden;
    }

    a{
      text-decoration:none;
      color:inherit;
    }

    img{
      display:block;
      max-width:100%;
    }

    .container{
      width:min(1150px, 92%);
      margin:auto;
    }

    .section{
      padding:100px 0;
      position:relative;
    }

    .section-title{
      font-size:clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
      text-align:center;
      margin-bottom:14px;
      letter-spacing:.3px;
    }

    .section-subtitle{
      max-width:760px;
      margin:0 auto 48px;
      text-align:center;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:16px;
      line-height:1.9;
    }

    .gradient-text{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffffff,#9dc4ff,#c6b2ff);
      -webkit-background-clip:text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
      background-clip:text;
      color:transparent;
    }

    .navbar{
      position:sticky;
      top:0;
      z-index:1000;
      background:rgba(7,16,29,.82);
      backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .nav-wrap{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:center;
      gap:20px;
      padding:18px 0;
    }

    .logo{
      font-size:30px;
      font-weight:800;
      letter-spacing:.5px;
    }

    .logo span{
      color:var(--blue);
    }

    .nav-links{
      display:flex;
      gap:26px;
      align-items:center;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .nav-links a{
      color:#dce7fb;
      font-size:15px;
      transition:var(--transition);
      position:relative;
    }

    .nav-links a::after{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      left:0;
      bottom:-6px;
      width:0;
      height:2px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),var(--purple));
      transition:var(--transition);
    }

    .nav-links a:hover::after{
      width:100%;
    }

    .nav-btn{
      padding:12px 18px;
      border-radius:14px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),var(--purple));
      font-weight:700;
      box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(110,168,255,.18);
    }

    .hero{
      min-height:100vh;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      padding:70px 0 40px;
      position:relative;
    }

    .hero::before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      width:420px;
      height:420px;
      right:-120px;
      top:80px;
      background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(101,214,255,.18), transparent 60%);
      pointer-events:none;
      filter:blur(10px);
    }

    .hero-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;
      gap:34px;
      align-items:center;
    }

    .badge{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:10px;
      padding:12px 18px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      color:#eef4ff;
      font-size:14px;
      margin-bottom:22px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .badge-dot{
      width:10px;
      height:10px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--cyan),var(--blue));
      box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(101,214,255,.9);
    }

    .hero-text h1{
      font-size:clamp(42px, 7vw, 78px);
      line-height:1.02;
      margin-bottom:14px;
      letter-spacing:-1px;
    }

    .hero-text h2{
      font-size:clamp(22px, 3.8vw, 34px);
      color:#bdd4ff;
      line-height:1.35;
      margin-bottom:18px;
      font-weight:700;
    }

    .hero-text p{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:18px;
      line-height:1.95;
      max-width:650px;
      margin-bottom:28px;
    }

    .hero-actions{
      display:flex;
      gap:14px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      margin-bottom:28px;
    }

    .btn{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      min-width:170px;
      padding:16px 24px;
      border-radius:16px;
      font-weight:700;
      transition:var(--transition);
      border:1px solid transparent;
    }

    .btn-primary{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),var(--purple));
      box-shadow:0 14px 35px rgba(110,168,255,.22);
    }

    .btn-secondary{
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border-color:var(--border);
    }

    .btn:hover{
      transform:translateY(-5px);
    }

    .hero-stats{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:16px;
    }

    .stat{
      background:var(--surface);
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:22px;
      padding:22px 18px;
      text-align:center;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      transition:var(--transition);
    }

    .stat:hover{
      transform:translateY(-6px);
    }

    .stat h3{
      font-size:30px;
      margin-bottom:6px;
    }

    .stat p{
      font-size:14px;
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.7;
    }

    .hero-card{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.08), rgba(255,255,255,.04));
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:30px;
      padding:18px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .hero-card::before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      inset:auto auto -60px -60px;
      width:180px;
      height:180px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(110,168,255,.20), transparent 70%);
      filter:blur(8px);
    }

    .hero-image{
      border-radius:24px;
      overflow:hidden;
      background:#111827;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    }

    .hero-image img{
      width:100%;
      height:560px;
      object-fit:cover;
      object-position:center;
    }

    .profile-fallback{
      display:none;
      width:100%;
      height:560px;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      flex-direction:column;
      gap:14px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(110,168,255,.12), rgba(143,107,255,.12));
      padding:20px;
      text-align:center;
    }

    .fallback-circle{
      width:110px;
      height:110px;
      border-radius:50%;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      font-size:42px;
      font-weight:800;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    }

    .mini-panel{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:12px;
      margin-top:16px;
    }

    .mini-box{
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:18px;
      padding:16px;
      text-align:center;
      transition:var(--transition);
    }

    .mini-box:hover{
      transform:translateY(-4px);
    }

    .mini-box strong{
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:4px;
      font-size:17px;
    }

    .mini-box span{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:13px;
      line-height:1.6;
    }

    .about-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;
      gap:24px;
      align-items:stretch;
    }

    .card{
      background:var(--surface);
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:var(--radius);
      padding:28px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .about-text{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:17px;
      line-height:2;
    }

    .highlights{
      display:grid;
      gap:16px;
    }

    .highlight{
      background:var(--surface-2);
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:20px;
      padding:20px;
      transition:var(--transition);
    }

    .highlight:hover{
      transform:translateY(-5px);
    }

    .highlight h3{
      font-size:20px;
      margin-bottom:8px;
    }

    .highlight p{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:15px;
      line-height:1.9;
    }

    .skills-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
      gap:18px;
    }

    .skill-card{
      background:var(--surface);
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:22px;
      padding:24px;
      text-align:center;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      transition:var(--transition);
    }

    .skill-card:hover{
      transform:translateY(-8px);
      border-color:rgba(110,168,255,.35);
    }

    .skill-icon{
      width:64px;
      height:64px;
      margin:0 auto 16px;
      border-radius:18px;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      font-size:24px;
      font-weight:800;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(110,168,255,.18), rgba(143,107,255,.18));
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(110,168,255,.12);
    }

    .skill-card h3{
      margin-bottom:8px;
      font-size:20px;
    }

    .skill-card p{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:14px;
      line-height:1.8;
    }

    .services-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
      gap:20px;
    }

    .service-card{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.07), rgba(255,255,255,.04));
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:24px;
      padding:26px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      transition:var(--transition);
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .service-card::before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      top:-40px;
      right:-40px;
      width:120px;
      height:120px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(110,168,255,.14), transparent 70%);
    }

    .service-card:hover{
      transform:translateY(-8px);
    }

    .service-card h3{
      font-size:23px;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }

    .service-card p{
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.9;
      font-size:15px;
    }

    .projects-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));
      gap:22px;
    }

    .project-card{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.07), rgba(255,255,255,.04));
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:26px;
      overflow:hidden;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      transition:var(--transition);
    }

    .project-card:hover{
      transform:translateY(-10px);
    }

    .project-cover{
      height:220px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(5,10,18,.20), rgba(5,10,18,.20)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441986300917-64674bd600d8?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover no-repeat;
    }

    .project-cover.two{
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(5,10,18,.20), rgba(5,10,18,.20)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover no-repeat;
    }

    .project-body{
      padding:24px;
    }

    .project-tag{
      display:inline-block;
      margin-bottom:10px;
      color:#b8d2ff;
      font-size:14px;
      font-weight:700;
    }

    .project-body h3{
      font-size:28px;
      margin-bottom:10px;
    }

    .project-body p{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:15px;
      line-height:1.9;
      margin-bottom:16px;
    }

    .project-list{
      list-style:none;
      display:grid;
      gap:8px;
      margin-bottom:20px;
    }

    .project-list li{
      color:#dce6fb;
      position:relative;
      padding-left:18px;
      font-size:14px;
      line-height:1.7;
    }

    .project-list li::before{
      content:"•";
      position:absolute;
      left:0;
      top:0;
      color:var(--blue);
    }

    .project-actions{
      display:flex;
      gap:12px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .contact-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
      gap:18px;
    }

    .contact-card{
      background:var(--surface);
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:22px;
      padding:24px;
      text-align:center;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      transition:var(--transition);
    }

    .contact-card:hover{
      transform:translateY(-6px);
    }

    .contact-card h3{
      font-size:21px;
      margin-bottom:10px;
    }

    .contact-card p,
    .contact-card a{
      color:var(--muted);
      word-break:break-word;
      line-height:1.8;
      font-size:15px;
    }

    .cta{
      margin-top:42px;
    }

    .cta-box{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(110,168,255,.14), rgba(143,107,255,.12));
      border:1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius:28px;
      padding:34px;
      text-align:center;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .cta-box h3{
      font-size:32px;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }

    .cta-box p{
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.9;
      margin-bottom:18px;
      font-size:16px;
    }

    .cta-actions{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
      gap:12px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .footer{
      padding:30px 0 42px;
      border-top:1px solid var(--border);
      color:var(--muted);
      text-align:center;
      font-size:15px;
    }

    .reveal{
      opacity:0;
      transform:translateY(40px);
      transition:all .8s ease;
    }

    .reveal.active{
      opacity:1;
      transform:translateY(0);
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px){
      .hero-grid,
      .about-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }

      .hero-text{
        text-align:center;
      }

      .hero-text p{
        margin-left:auto;
        margin-right:auto;
      }

      .hero-actions{
        justify-content:center;
      }

      .hero-stats{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px){
      .nav-wrap{
        flex-direction:column;
      }

      .nav-links{
        justify-content:center;
        gap:14px;
      }

      .nav-btn{
        display:none;
      }

      .hero{
        padding-top:40px;
      }

      .hero-image img,
      .profile-fallback{
        height:420px;
      }

      .mini-panel{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }

      .btn{
        width:100%;
        min-width:unset;
      }

      .hero-actions,
      .project-actions,
      .cta-actions{
        flex-direction:column;
      }

      .section{
        padding:75px 0;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header class="navbar">
    <div class="container nav-wrap">
      <div class="logo">Eslam<span>.</span></div>

      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>

      <a href="#contact" class="nav-btn">Hire Me</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-text reveal">
        <span class="badge"><span class="badge-dot"></span> Available for freelance & front-end opportunities</span>
        <h1>Hi, I'm <span class="gradient-text">Eslam Mesalam</span></h1>
        <h2>Front-End Developer crafting modern websites with clean design and smooth experience.</h2>
        <p>
          I build responsive, elegant, and professional websites using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
          My goal is to turn ideas into real digital experiences that look premium, feel smooth,
          and help brands stand out online.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-primary">View Projects</a>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Contact Me</a>
          <a href="cv.pdf" download class="btn btn-secondary">Download CV</a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-stats">
          <div class="stat reveal">
            <h3>2+</h3>
            <p>Featured Projects</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stat reveal">
            <h3>6+</h3>
            <p>Core Skills</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stat reveal">
            <h3>100%</h3>
            <p>Passion & Growth</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-card reveal">
        <div class="hero-image">
          <img src="profile.jpg" alt="Eslam Mesalam"
               onerror="this.style.display='none'; document.getElementById('fallbackProfile').style.display='flex';">
          <div class="profile-fallback" id="fallbackProfile">
            <div class="fallback-circle">EM</div>
            <h3>Eslam Mesalam</h3>
            <p>ضع الصورة باسم profile.jpg داخل نفس الفولدر</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mini-panel">
          <div class="mini-box">
            <strong>UI Focus</strong>
            <span>Modern clean design</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mini-box">
            <strong>Responsive</strong>
            <span>Mobile & desktop ready</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mini-box">
            <strong>Fast Learner</strong>
            <span>Always improving</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="about">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">About Me</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle reveal">
        A short introduction about who I am and the type of web experiences I enjoy building.
      </p>

      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="card reveal">
          <p class="about-text">
            I am a passionate Front-End Developer with a strong interest in building visually attractive,
            responsive, and user-friendly websites. I enjoy turning ideas into modern digital experiences
            through clean layouts, strong typography, and smooth interfaces. I focus on creating websites
            that are not only beautiful, but also practical, fast, and professional. My goal is to keep
            growing through real projects and deliver front-end work that reflects quality and attention to detail.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="highlights">
          <div class="highlight reveal">
            <h3>Clean Design</h3>
            <p>I care about strong layout, elegant spacing, premium sections, and polished visual details.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="highlight reveal">
            <h3>Responsive Experience</h3>
            <p>I build websites that look great and work smoothly across mobile phones, tablets, and desktop screens.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="highlight reveal">
            <h3>Growth Mindset</h3>
            <p>I am constantly learning, practicing, and improving my front-end skills through real projects.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="skills">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">My Skills</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle reveal">
        Technologies and strengths I use to create modern, high-quality user interfaces.
      </p>

      <div class="skills-grid">
        <div class="skill-card reveal">